### Requetes de test via l'API Gateway (extension "REST Client" VS Code ou IntelliJ HTTP Client)
@gw = http://localhost:8080/api

### Vehicules (filtres : categorie, carburant, statut, prixMax)
GET {{gw}}/vehicules?categorie=SUV&prixMax=200

### Detail / 404
GET {{gw}}/vehicules/1
###
GET {{gw}}/vehicules/999

### Creation (201) puis meme immatriculation (409)
POST {{gw}}/vehicules
Content-Type: application/json

{"immatriculation":"111 TUN 2222","marque":"Seat","modele":"Ibiza","annee":2023,"couleur":"Rouge","categorie":"ECONOMIQUE","carburant":"ESSENCE","boite":"MANUELLE","nbPlaces":5,"kilometrage":1000,"prixJournalier":85}

### Prix negatif -> 400
POST {{gw}}/vehicules
Content-Type: application/json

{"immatriculation":"222 TUN 3333","marque":"Seat","modele":"Leon","annee":2023,"categorie":"BERLINE","carburant":"DIESEL","boite":"MANUELLE","nbPlaces":5,"kilometrage":0,"prixJournalier":-5}

### Clients
GET {{gw}}/clients?q=ben
###
GET {{gw}}/clients/1/eligibilite
### Client trop jeune (id 4) et permis expire (id 5)
GET {{gw}}/clients/4/eligibilite
###
GET {{gw}}/clients/5/eligibilite

### Vehicules disponibles sur une periode (adapter les dates)
GET {{gw}}/locations/disponibilites?dateDebut=2026-12-01&dateFin=2026-12-05

### Simulation du prix
POST {{gw}}/locations/simulation
Content-Type: application/json

{"clientId":3,"vehiculeId":3,"dateDebut":"2026-12-01","dateFinPrevue":"2026-12-04"}

### Reservation (201)
POST {{gw}}/locations
Content-Type: application/json

{"clientId":1,"vehiculeId":1,"dateDebut":"2026-12-01","dateFinPrevue":"2026-12-04"}

### Meme vehicule, periode qui chevauche -> 409
POST {{gw}}/locations
Content-Type: application/json

{"clientId":2,"vehiculeId":1,"dateDebut":"2026-12-02","dateFinPrevue":"2026-12-06"}

### Client non eligible -> 409
POST {{gw}}/locations
Content-Type: application/json

{"clientId":4,"vehiculeId":2,"dateDebut":"2026-12-01","dateFinPrevue":"2026-12-04"}

### Depart (vehicule -> LOUE)
PATCH {{gw}}/locations/1/depart

### Suppression d'un vehicule loue -> 409
DELETE {{gw}}/vehicules/1

### Retour avec retard (dateRetourEffectif apres dateFinPrevue -> penalite)
PATCH {{gw}}/locations/1/retour
Content-Type: application/json

{"kmRetour":18900,"dateRetourEffectif":"2026-12-06"}

### Annulation d'une reservation
PATCH {{gw}}/locations/2/annulation

### Liste paginee / detail enrichi / statistiques
GET {{gw}}/locations?statut=TERMINEE&page=0&size=5
###
GET {{gw}}/locations/1
###
GET {{gw}}/locations/statistiques
